{'symbol': 'AEP', 'date': '2019-10-21 22:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER COMPANY, INC. DECLARES A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 10, 2019', 'text': "THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AMERICAN ELECTRIC POWER CO. DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF 70 CENTS A SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, AN INCREASE OF 3 CENTS PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE DECEMBER 10, 2019, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF NOVEMBER 8, 2019."}